~ mad_mage_001_02
Mad mage: Oh. It's you.

Zaar: Another famous person I've never heard before?

Alastor: This time you are not alone.

Mad mage: Why don't you introduce us, Aven?

Elliot: Allow me. Zaar, Alastor, this man is the second founder of the council, Neiro. He left his post about a millennium and a half ago. And around five hundred years, give or take, he disappeared without a trace.

Neiro: I didn't ask you to tell my entire live story, Chancellor.

Elliot: It's High Chancellor to you.

Neiro: Hohoho. Why so resentful? Did I mistreat you in some way?

Zaar: You poisoned the whole world, you mad bastard!

Neiro: I did not ask for a demon's opinion. You have brought quite a company, Aven.

Aven: You brought it upon yourself. What were you trying to achieve here?

do ObjectLink.cutscene_player.play("turn_02")
Neiro: Argh! If only you would listen to me before! But it's alright. I will gladly explain it again. We are inside the Beast. The one that consumes souls of the dead. I seek its destruction.

Aven: You know not the consequences of your actions. You are killing people by the thousands and displacing even more.

Neiro: If this is what it takes to be free from the Beast, so be it.

Zaar: Is it true? That souls end up here after death?

Alastor: I am sure that's just the nonsense of a madman. Right, Archchancellor?

Aven: …

Alastor: Huh?

Elliot: It's true.

Alastor: …

Zaar: Then… Those weird creatures… Were they people before?

Elliot: Are you afraid?

Zaar: I am…

Aven: Lost. For all that I learned in my life, I know that there is a lot that I don't know. I cannot tell what will happen when I or someone else dies, but surely you must recognize that what he is doing is wrong.

Zaar: I… agree. Let's end his crusade of madness and return home.

Elliot: Good thinking. I am already fed up with this place.

Alastor: I concur.

Neiro: WHY?! Why can't you understand?! Why must you stand in my way? No matter. If you wish to perish, I will gladly be the one to send you off.
do ObjectLink.cutscene.next_scene("res://map_data_res/mad_mage_map.tres")
=> END

