~ evelyn_and_mad_mage
Neiro: YOU!

Evelyn: So you are the one who is responsible for this mess. Hmm… I think I know you. What was your name again?

Neiro: It's Neiro, Evelyn.

Evelyn: I don't remember allowing you this level of familiarity, pest.

Neiro: So what? I am no longer scared of you! Even you can't stop me now! No one can!

Evelyn: Hmm. Staff with an unfaceted Dragon scale. And [i]you[/i] can cast magic in its vicinity. Impressive. You have grown since our last encounter.

Neiro: Thank you for the compliment! Surely you recognize there is no chance for you to win now.

Evelyn: How so?

Neiro: Ugh! No spell can survive in its vicinity.

Evelyn: But yours can?

Neiro: It took me decades to adapt to a field of magic chaos that this thing creates. Casting magic near it is like trying to blow a storm with a handheld fan. I myself can only use internal magic, like self-strengthening and healing. What hope do you have?

Evelyn: As one would expect. Its effect is similar to the environment of this place, just magnitudes stronger. But it still can be overcome with enough magic.

Neiro: HAHAHA! You mad witch! As if there exists a mage with such a ridiculous amount of magic.

Evelyn: Probably not. No one can store such an amount in themself.
do ObjectLink.cutscene_player.play("evelyn_knife_takeout")
=> END

