Evelyn: Throat? I will reap your damned head off with my bare hands. As if I would ever use his gift on a filth, such as you. You said no mage can hold enough magic to break through your staff. But one can still channel enough to silence you forever.

Neiro: HAHAHA! And what is tha…
do ObjectLink.cutscene_player.play("evelyn_knife_stab")
