~ evelyn_and_group
Evelyn: Still alive, old man?

Aven: Barely, Your Excellence.

Evelyn: Finally, someone who knows their place. I must say, I was not expecting you to fail the task I left you with. It was such an easy task, and yet. What excuse are you going to use to weasel out?

Aven: The Dragon Scale is an astronomically rare artifact. The fact that Neiro went insane and that he would find one. I simply could not foresee something like that.

Evelyn: And you just added two more failings to the list. You allowed such a rare artifact slip by unnoticed and failed to keep tabs on a powerful mage. You just keep digging the hole you are in.

do ObjectLink.cutscene_player.play("evelyn_group_zaar_stand")
